// Mainnet-fork loader (scout). Clones real Marinade mainnet state into the SVM
// at its real addresses so the primary user-value actions (deposit,
// liquid_unstake, add_liquidity, remove_liquidity) run against a fork of real
// on-chain state instead of the synthetic isolated world. Fixtures live at
// fixtures/mainnet/<name>.bin (raw account data) and are embedded via relative
// include_bytes! (relative paths only, so the harness relocates).
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
